arily performance under pressure. B also has weak memory for numbers, which is concerning for attention.\n\nD has good concentration, solves problems, takes responsibility. So D seems more balanced despite temper. I think D is best overall.\n\nThus initial recommendation: Candidate D.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none yet) but we can say \"Given the criteria, I propose D\". Provide evidence: concentration, problem solving, responsibility, but note concerns.\n\nLet's produce public message."}
